\\dot{E}_{A} \\sim 1.8\\times 10^{35}\\left[\\frac{B_{B}(R_{B})}{10^{12}\\,\\rm{G}} \\right]^{-1}\\left(\\frac{\\chi_{A}}{0.1}\\right)\\left(\\frac{\\chi_{R}}{0.1}\\right) ^{3/2}  \\times\\left(\\frac{\\xi}{10^{-3}}\\right)^{-3/2}\\,\\rm{erg\\,s}^{-1}\\,.

